  "description": "Minimal, Effective, Safe and Fully Async Serilog Sink that allows sending messages to pre-defined list of users in Telegram chat. It uses HttpClient singleton, Channel queue and StringBuilder pool to optimize memory using (no mem leaks) and performance.",
